  "notes": "{溜|た}める is an ichidan verb meaning to save up or let accumulate.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{溜|た}まる→溜まる：02067_tamaru⟧ (intransitive, to pile up)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦お{金|かね}→お金：00611_okane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{溜|た}める: to save money\n- ⟦ポイント→ポイント：11283_pointo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{溜|た}める: to collect points\n- ⟦ストレス→ストレス：03827_sutoresu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{溜|た}める: to let stress build up\n- ⟦{力|ちから}→力：01661_chikara⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{溜|た}める: to build up strength\n- ⟦{息|いき}→息：02176_iki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{溜|た}める: to hold one's breath\n\nWRITING:\nAlso written as ⟦{貯|た}める→貯める：27801_tameru⟧ (⟦{貯金|ちょきん}→貯金：03497_chokin⟧ = savings). {溜|た}める emphasizes accumulation; ⟦{貯|た}める→貯める：27801_tameru⟧ emphasizes storing/saving.",
